OL,3,GNEWSAMan in court accused of killing
OL,4,Atwo cyclists in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has appeared in court accused of
OL,7,Fkilling two cyclists and injuring
OL,8,Fanother in a crash in Kent.
OL,10,FAaron Turner, 22, from St Patrick's
OL,11,FGardens in Gravesend, was bailed after
OL,12,Fappearing by video link at Medway
OL,13,FMagistrates' Court charged with causing
OL,14,Fdeath by dangerous driving.
OL,16,FNatasha Lewis, 51, and Steven Anscomb,
OL,17,F60, died of "traumatic and
OL,18,Fcatastrophic" injuries in the crash
OL,19,Fnear Gravesend on Sunday, and the third
OL,20,Fcyclist was treated in hospital, the
OL,21,Fcourt heard.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
