OL,3,GNEWSAMan in court accused of killing
OL,4,Atwo cyclists in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTurner is accused of having "lost
OL,7,Fcontrol" of his white Ford Focus while
OL,8,Ftravelling south-west near the village
OL,9,Fof Sole Street at about 07:45 BST.
